{% import 'landing/sections/_shot.html.twig' as shot %}

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ WEEKLY TICK ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">How it Works</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">One tap. One week. Infinite consequences.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">The Weekly Tick engine runs entirely on-device — no internet required mid-game. When you're ready, Integrity Sync validates your progress and updates your position across {{ world.totals.leaderboardCategories }} global leaderboards.</p>

        <div class="feature-split">
            <div class="tick-grid">
                <div class="tick-step" data-num="01">
                    <div class="tick-step-title">Make Your Decisions</div>
                    <p class="tick-step-text">Manage transfers, allocate budget to facility upgrades, respond to inbox messages from agents, sponsors, investors, and your board. React to guardian demands. Delegate what you don't want to handle yourself.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tick-step" data-num="02">
                    <div class="tick-step-title">Advance the Week</div>
                    <p class="tick-step-text">The engine simulates your match using Style Multipliers for the matchup, processes wages, applies facility benefits to development, fires narrative incidents — all offline, all on-device. Every one of the {{ world.totals.npcClubs }} rival AI clubs in your pyramid is advancing too, managing its own budget and chasing its own signings.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tick-step" data-num="03">
                    <div class="tick-step-title">React to Results</div>
                    <p class="tick-step-text">Read the full match report, check your league position, accept or reject transfer bids. Player morale shifts. Fan happiness reacts. The NPC market moves.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tick-step" data-num="04">
                    <div class="tick-step-title">Sync &amp; Compete</div>
                    <p class="tick-step-text">Integrity Sync submits your week to the server — rollbacks rejected, progress validated. Your position across {{ world.totals.leaderboardCategories }} global leaderboard categories updates instantly. Climb the pyramid. Win a title. Get relegated. Your record is permanent either way.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <figure class="feature-shot">
                {{ shot.img('weekly-tick-processing', 'The week advancing — checklist ticking off squad morale and relationships, Director of Football at work, wrapping up the week and sending reports to head office, 65% complete', false, 340, '2026-10') }}
                <figcaption>One tap advances the week — everything above happens on-device</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
